SUMMARY:Phil's Hills: Cat Back Repeats
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride Leader:** Phil New
 swanger\n\n**Phil’s Hills**: a series of structured hill repeat rides de
 signed to build strength\, endurance and boost your overall fitness.\n\n**
 Route link:** [Phil's Hills: Cat Back Repeats](https://ridewithgps.com/rou
 tes/53981786)\n**PDF link:** [Cuesheet](https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
 /assets.modomadethis.com/cuesheets/Phils_Hills_Cat_Back_Repeats.pdf)\n\nWh
 at to Expect:\n\n* **Route:** Expect a total distance of approximately **1
 5-20 miles**\, including **3-4 loops** of a circuit featuring **1-2 climbi
 ng segment**.\n* **Focus:** We'll emphasize maintaining a consistent climb
 ing tempo\, active recovery between efforts\, and repeating the effort to 
 build power and efficiency.\n* **Pace:** We'll maintain a comfortable aver
 age pace range of **14-16 mph**.\n* **No-Drop Policy:** You'll never be le
 ft behind! We'll regroup after climbs to ensure everyone stays together.\n
 \n\\-\\-\\-\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds or audible music-playing 
 devices. Please bring water\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire le
 vers\, pump/CO2 inflator).
