SUMMARY:LBC Bike to 30K Program: Ride #8 Chickies Creek Short (12 Miles)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Grab your helmets\, bik
 es\, and sneakers — Lancaster Bicycle Club is gearing up for beginner an
 d transitional rides!** Local members of the LBC are thrilled to host this
  year’s **Bike to 30K Program**\, designed especially for new\, returnin
 g\, and curious cyclists.\n\n## **About the Program**\n\nBike to 30K is a 
 seven‑week series that gently builds your confidence\, fitness\, and mil
 eage. We begin with a five‑mile ride and gradually work up to eighteen m
 iles by the end of the program. Our goal is simple: to introduce riders of
  all experience levels to the joy of cycling in a supportive\, community
 ‑focused environment.\nThis program is **FREE** with an LBC membership 
 — and membership is also free. The Bike to 30K program is open to everyo
 ne in our community who wants to ride.\n\n## **Why We Ride**\n\nEver wonde
 r why cyclists keep coming back? Because it’s fun. There’s nothing lik
 e coasting downhill and letting out a big “weeeeeee” all the way to th
 e bottom. But we also know that if you’re new to cycling\, jumping strai
 ght into an 18‑mile ride can feel intimidating. That’s exactly why Bik
 e to 30K exists.\nEach week\, you’ll increase your mileage at a comforta
 ble pace. You’ll get to know the club\, meet fellow riders\, and gradual
 ly grow into a confident **Fun Rider** — the group known for enjoying sc
 enic\, social rides together.\n\n## **Our Commitment to You**\n\nLancaster
  Bicycle Club is dedicated to supporting new riders and helping our commun
 ity reach their cycling goals. Bike to 30K is part of our initiative to en
 courage more people to get outside\, get active\, and discover how enjoyab
 le cycling can be.\nSpend seven weeks with us and watch yourself transform
  into a Fun Rider — one mile at a time.\nThe Bike to 30K program is volu
 ntary\, welcoming\, and designed with beginners in mind. We can’t wait t
 o ride with you.\n\n## **Membership\, Waiver & RSVP Requirements**\n\nTo e
 liminate passing around a pen‑and‑paper waiver\, we require both:\n\n*
  **LBC Club Membership**\, and\n* **Meetup RSVP**\n\nYour RSVP allows us t
 o contact you after the ride if needed. Please note: **ONLY club members w
 ho RSVP are covered by the club’s excess accident insurance policy.** Be
 ing on Meetup does *not* mean you are a club member. To join our wonderful
  club\, please sign up through our membership link.\n\n## **Before You Arr
 ive**\n\nPlease plan to arrive **10–15 minutes before the ride** and ens
 ure your bike is in good working condition. Helmets are mandatory. Please 
 also bring:\n\n* 1–2 water bottles\n* A basic repair kit (spare tube\, t
 ire levers\, pump or CO₂ inflator)\n\nFor everyone’s safety\, **earbud
 s and music are not allowed**.\n\n## **RSVP Required**\n\nYour RSVP is you
 r agreement to follow:\n\n* The club’s **Code of Conduct**\n* The **Rule
 s of the Road**\n* Our **Ride Waiver**\n\n## **Stay Connected**\n\nWe’ve
  gone social! Join us on Facebook: **https://www.facebook.com/B230K**\n\n#
 # **What to Bring**\n\nWater bottle • Bike • Helmet • Sneakers\n\nCu
 e Sheet to the Ride: https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/ep-chickies-
 creek-short-12f-2/\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*
 \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\
 *\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\
 \*\\*\\*\\*\n***The Bike to 30K is brought to you by Lancaster Bicycle Clu
 b and Lancaster Trek Bikes.***
